  "overview": "Kick some serious butt!\n\nAliens have invaded L.A. and taken it hostage. Run, swim, jump and fly in full 3D freedom as you blast assault troopers, enforcers, and octabrains to rescue the City of Angels. Then, discover the truth behind the alien invasion and boot those nasties outta the solar system.\n\n- 27 carnage-filled levels, including a new Saturn-exclusive level.\n- All the weapons, enemies and action from the huge PC hit.\n- Use Net Link to connect with another player for head-to-head on-line action.\n- The most realistic 3D environments yet. Enhanced lighting and audio."
